classDiagram
class HttpServer {
  -EventLoop m_loop
  -TcpServer m_server
  -Handler m_handler
  -milliseconds m_timeout
  -unordered_map m_requests
  +HttpServer(loop, address, port, handler, timeout)
  +~HttpServer()
  +start() void
  +stop() void
  +port() uint16_t
  +connectionCount() size_t
  -receive(connection, input) void
  -respond(connection, response) void
}
HttpServer *-- TcpServer : transport
HttpServer ..> HttpParser : request boundary
HttpServer --> EventLoop : request deadline
